## Page contents

| Section | Focus |
|---------|--------|
| **Purpose** | Forge theme personality — amber/cyan roles, dark foundation, theme-pack consistency; PDCA framing |
| **Passing signals** | Stable accent roles (`section-label text-cyan`, `card-amber`, `btn-forge`, `btn-cyan-outline`), focal `forge-gradient-text`, consistent theme packs |
| **Failing signals** | Accent roulette, gradient overload, theme-pack collision, light/dark whiplash, Bootstrap vs Forge button mix |
| **Before example** | Failing HTML: inline hex, `btn-success`/`btn-warning`/`btn-info`, gradient on multiple headings, `bg-light` band |
| **After example** | Passing HTML: `fs-landing-hero-band`, `landing-hero-kicker`, single gradient hero title, `forge-card card-amber`, neutral `glass` tile |
| **Evidence and remediation** | Screenshot capture + 7-step remediation ladder |
| **Related rules** | Links to premium feel, ambient readability, hierarchy, and `DET.THEME.*` / `DET.TOKEN.*` companions |

